B.aCv=new A.cC("Apni zubaan, apna shehar aur app ke jo hisse chahiye wo chuniye. Home par sirf wahi dikhega. Baad mein Settings \u2192 Modules mein kabhi bhi badal sakte hain. App internet ke bina bhi chalta hai.","Shuruaat")
B.aC5=new A.cC('Quran kholiye \u2192 Surah ya Para chuniye. Padhne ki settings (slider wala icon) mein IndoPak ya Uthmani khat chuniye aur akshar bade kijiye. Har ayat ke saath uska hawala (jaise 2:255) dikhta hai. App yaad rakhta hai aap kahan ruke the \u2014 Home par "Wahin se padhiye" dabaiye.',"Quran padhna")
B.aCp=new A.cC("Ayat ke paas bookmark icon dabaiye, ya ayat ko der tak dabaiye: hawale ke saath copy, ya ghalti batayiye. Talaash mein Arabic, Urdu, surah ka naam kisi bhi spelling mein (yasin, yaseen) ya hawala jaise 36:1 likhiye.","Bookmark, copy aur talaash")
B.aCz=new A.cC("Tarjuma tabhi dikhega jab hamare ulama uske source ki tasdeeq kar denge. Tab tak reader mein ek note dikhta hai.","Tarjuma")
B.aDc=new A.cC('Apna shehar chuniye ya "Meri abhi ki jagah lijiye" dabaiye. Hisaab University of Islamic Sciences, Karachi aur Hanafi Asr ke mutabik hai. Advanced mode (Settings mein Aasaan mode band karke) mein har waqt ko kuch minute aage-peeche karke apni masjid se mila sakte hain. Chaand ki ruyat alag ho to Hijri tareekh \xb12 din adjust kijiye.',"Namaz ke waqt")
B.aD9=new A.cC('Yaad-dehani sirf vibrate karti hai. Android par "Alarms & reminders" allow kijiye aur is app ka battery optimisation band kijiye. Xiaomi, Redmi, Oppo, Vivo, Realme aur kuch Samsung phones mein "Autostart" on kijiye aur battery ko "No restrictions" par rakhiye, warna phone yaad-dehani rok sakta hai.',"Yaad-dehani nahi baj rahi?")
B.aCr=new A.cC("Phone seedha rakhiye aur lohe, magnet aur bijli ke taaron se door rakhiye. Teer galat lage to phone ko 8 ki shakal mein kuch baar ghumaiye. North se angle bhi likha hota hai, kisi bhi compass se dekh sakte hain.","Qibla")
B.aCo=new A.cC("Tasbih: ginne ke liye kahin bhi tap kijiye; target 33, 99, 100 ya 1000 chuniye. Namaz record: har namaz ko waqt par, jama'at ke saath, qaza ya chhoot gayi mark kijiye. Ye record sirf aapke phone mein rehta hai, kabhi share ya compare nahi hota.","Tasbih aur namaz record")
B.aCZ=new A.cC("Koi ads nahi, data bechna nahi. Aapki jagah sirf phone par waqt nikaalne ke liye istemaal hoti hai. Settings, bookmarks aur namaz record isi phone mein rehte hain.","Privacy")
B.aD1=new A.cC("Settings \u2192 App ke baare mein aur sources mein har ibarat ka source, uska license aur app ka ilmi meyaar likha hai. Koi ghalti mile to ayat ko der tak dabaiye \u2192 Ghalti batayiye.","Sources aur ghalti")
